## What to build

Deliver a browser dashboard connected to real persisted execution events. Display phase, DAG, agents, attempts, integration queue, checks, skipped validation and bounded logs, with distinct waiting/failed/skipped/passed states. Serve authenticated read-only endpoints on loopback and reconnect event streams without losing ordering. The dashboard does not approve, answer, pause, retry or stop anything.

