- `bun test tests/integration/08-concurrency.test.ts`: 9 passed, 0 failed; 121 assertions.
- `bunx biome check` on all 18 touched source/test files: passed.
- `bun run lint`: blocked only by the pre-existing formatting error in `tests/browser/dashboard.test.ts:38`, left unchanged under the unrelated-file constraint.

The issue-7 hung-check fixture now approves cleanup of its untracked readiness marker
and asserts integration on attempt one. This keeps the timeout regression focused on
omission rather than an incidental dirty-worktree repair, while preserving the original
clock deadline and candidate-cleanliness policy.

- Final fresh-process `bun test --timeout 30000 tests/integration`: 165 passed, 1 opt-in browser test skipped, 0 failed; 958 assertions across 14 files. This run includes the final shared-slot implementation and fixture cleanup correction.
